OL,3,GNEWSACounty signs will not return until
OL,4,Aearly next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in Rutland will have to wait a
OL,7,Fwhile longer before seeing the return
OL,8,Fof county boundary road signs that were
OL,9,Fremoved by the county council earlier
OL,10,Fthis year.
OL,12,FThieves were reported to have stolen 10
OL,13,Fof the signs in the summer, with the
OL,14,Fcounty council then removing the
OL,15,Fremaining17 for "safekeeping".
OL,17,FThe Liberal Democtat-led authority has
OL,18,Fsaid the county boundary markers will
OL,19,Fnow not return to roadsides until early
OL,20,Fin the new year, after roadworks have
OL,21,Fbeen completed.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
