OL,3,GNEWSACounty signs will not return until
OL,4,Aearly next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlicia Kearns, Conservative MP for
OL,7,FRutland and Stamford MP, and
OL,8,FConservative councillor Lucy Stephenson
OL,9,Fhave questioned why the council removed
OL,10,Fthe remaining signs, and suggested
OL,11,Ftemporary ones could have been put up.
